message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
title: "SweBEM"
abstract: >-
  Web tool for simulating the annual and hourly energy use of Swedish buildings
  with EnergyPlus. It covers eight building typologies, construction periods from
  before 1961 to after 2000, and 56 Swedish weather stations.
authors:
